{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"射影丛"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"射影丛"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>射影丛是"},{"Local":{"url":"射影空间","text":"射影空间"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"相对","text":"相对"}},{"Plain":"版本, 是"},{"Local":{"url":"相对射影谱","text":"相对射影谱"}},{"Plain":"的重要例子.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>代数几何</h3>\n<p>设 $E$ 是概形 $Y$ 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"拟凝聚层","text":"拟凝聚层"}},{"Plain":". 定义其<strong>射影丛</strong>为对称代数的"},{"Local":{"url":"相对射影谱","text":"相对射影谱"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\nP_Y(E):= \\operatorname{Proj}_Y(\\operatorname{Sym}_{\\mathcal O_Y}E).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Segre嵌入","text":"Segre 嵌入"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}